B.nj=new A.bG(B.k1,["Pawtbook \ud83d\udc3e","Care & SocialFi for All Your Pets in One Place","Connect Wallet (Solana)","Enter with Email (Embedded Wallet)","your@email.com","Feed","Marketplace","Profile","Rewards","+ Video","OFFICIAL PAWLY MERCH","Exclusive Pet Bandanas \ud83d\udc3e","Redeem with PawtScore or buy with Solana Pay (Wallet)","Featured Collection","Redeem Bandana","Get Points","Sponsor","Sponsor Pet","Select Sponsorship Amount:","Payment Method:","Solana Wallet\n(Web3)","Crypto\n(Solana Pay)","Pay with Solana Wallet","Pay with Solana Pay","Comments","Add a comment...","No comments yet. Be the first! \ud83d\udc3e","Human Profile (Sponsor)","Do you have a pet? \ud83d\udc3e","Register your pet to become a Creator and publish videos on Pawtbook.","Register Creator Pet","No active posts in the feed.","Refresh Feed","Solana Exclusive","Best Seller","Limited Edition","Summer Collection","Continue with Google","Points","Buy","Web3 Payment Method (Solana)","Solana Wallet (SOL / USDC)","Inappropriate language detected. Please keep comments friendly for pets! \ud83d\udc3e","Log Out","Terms and Conditions","Accept Terms and Create Account","Terms and Conditions","Pawtbook Platform Usage Guidelines \ud83d\udc3e","To interact, watch unlimited videos, like, comment, and sponsor pets on Solana, you must accept our terms and create your account.","1. Pet-Centric Ecosystem & Roles","Pawtbook is the pet-first social network and SocialFi platform on Solana where pets take center stage. Only registered pet profiles managed by their guardians can publish videos and photos. Human users act as sponsors, followers, and engage with the community.","2. Animal Welfare & Zero Tolerance for Abuse","It is strictly forbidden to upload, share, or promote content involving animal abuse, mistreatment, neglect, fighting, or exploitation. Pawtbook uses automated and community moderation. Any violation will result in immediate and permanent account suspension.","3. Solana Web3, PawtScore & Sponsorships","The rewards system, PawtScore, tips, and NFT badges utilize the Solana blockchain. Users are responsible for safeguarding their login credentials and wallet keys. Transactions on Solana are irreversible by network design.","4. Secure Storage & Data Privacy","All audiovisual media is stored and optimized on Cloudflare R2 with high-speed CDN. Your personal data is protected and never sold to third parties. By uploading content, you grant Pawtbook a license to display it in the global feed and associated profiles.","5. Acceptance & Policy Updates",'By registering and clicking "Accept Terms", you acknowledge that you have read and agreed to these terms of use and Pawtbook\'s privacy policy in full.',"I have read and agree to the Terms and Conditions of Use \ud83d\udc3e","\ud83d\udc3e Accept Terms and Create Account","\ud83d\udd11 Already have an account (Log In)","Understood","I accept the ","Terms and Conditions of Use \ud83d\udc3e","Please accept the Terms and Conditions of Use to create your account.","View Terms","Available stock","Sold Out","\u26a0\ufe0f This item is currently sold out.","Quantity to buy:","Maximum","unit","units","Select Payment Token (Solana):","Select your Solana Wallet:","Total","Pay with SOL","Pay with $SKR","\u26a1 Successful payment! Your item is on the way.","\u2139\ufe0f Payment cancelled in wallet. No charge was made.","\u26a0\ufe0f Error processing payment:","Redeem with PawtScore Points \ud83d\udc3e","pts each","Quantity:","Total Cost:","You have","Confirm Redemption","Insufficient Points","\ud83c\udf89 Successfully redeemed!","Admin Access","\u26a0\ufe0f Restricted access for admin only","Session","Enter administrator password:","Password","Verify Access","Cancel","\ud83d\udc3e You cannot sponsor your own pet. Sponsorships are granted by other community members.","\u26a1 Connecting to wallet...","\u270d\ufe0f Authorize transaction in wallet popup...","\ud83d\ude80 Confirming on Solana blockchain...","\u2139\ufe0f Transaction was cancelled in wallet. No charges made.","\u26a0\ufe0f Please enter a valid Solana wallet address."],t.l)
